  "question": {
    "text": "A very small sphere having a charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math>, uniformly distributed throughout its volume, is placed at the vertex of a cube of side&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi></math>. The electric flux through the cube is"
