  "solution": {
    "text": "If charge q is placed at a corner of cube, it will be divided into 8 such cubes. Therefore, electric flux through the cube is<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  }
